OL,3,AWelsh presenter to take on 'greatest
OL,4,Aever distance' in Children in Need
OL,5,Achallenge
OL,6,
OL,7,FRadio presenter Owain Wyn Evans will
OL,8,Fcycle through all four UK nations to
OL,9,Fraise money for BBC Children in Need.
OL,11,FThe Welsh host of BBC Radio 2's Early
OL,12,FBreakfast Show will travel almost 400
OL,13,Fmiles, setting off from Glasgow and
OL,14,Ffinishing in Cardiff.
OL,16,FThe five-day challenge will start on
OL,17,FMonday, 9 November, and finish on
OL,18,FFriday, 13 November - when the
OL,19,Ffundraiser will be broadcast.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
